      "content": "but i feel like the regular amounts dont really do anything for my energy levels. i keep reading that mega-dosing is the way to go for real results. if i stay super hydrated like u said, wouldnt that just neutralize the risk of the stones? i really want to try the 3000mg dose to see if i can get ahead of this. is there any reason i shouldn't just go for it?",
